The icons in this folder are Lucide, used unmodified in outline and shape.

Lucide is ISC licensed. Copyright (c) for portions of Lucide are held by
Cole Bemis 2013-2022 as part of Feather (MIT). All other copyright (c) for
Lucide are held by Lucide Contributors 2022.

https://lucide.dev

Every file carries stroke="currentColor" and no colour of its own. BRAIN
substitutes a palette token for that string at paint time, so an icon is
text_dim when it is idle and the accent when it is active without a second
copy of it existing.
